tu clear time after a GM change at t=0 with a PHC step at t=d (seconds; worst case over the prescaler phase)
     d    from GM change min..max     from step min..max   > 0.5 s from GM change
 0.000        0.252..0.500            0.252..0.500                         False
 0.020        0.271..0.519            0.251..0.499                          True
