Single event (d=0): clears 0.25..0.5 s after it, the implemented holdover.
Chained events: clears 0.25..0.5 s after the LAST pulse, so up to d+0.5 s
after the GM change. The head's rule measures from the discontinuity the
interval begins with; at fine observation resolution a correct design fails.
